@startuml warehouse_inventory_levels-overview
title Component - Levels - Overview
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam defaultTextAlignment<<atomic>> center
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
hide stereotype
<style>
.composite {
BackgroundColor: transparent
LineColor: darkgray
LineStyle: 5
FontStyle: normal
}
</style>
rectangle warehouse as "<U+00B1> Warehouse\n[system]" <<contains-changes>> <<composite>> {
rectangle warehouse.inventory as "<U+2192> Inventory (from shop.inventory)\n[container]" <<moved>> <<composite>> {
rectangle warehouse.inventory.levels <<moved>> <<component>> <<atomic>> [
<U+2192> Levels (from shop.inventory.levels)
[component]
The count of each book.
]
}
}
legend right
**To be** compared with **As is**
|= Mark |= Box |= Link |
| **+** | new: thick solid outline | new: thick solid line |
| **<U+007E>** | changed: dotted outline | changed: dotted line |
| **<U+2212>** | removed: dashed grey outline, struck title | removed: dashed grey line |
| **<U+00B1>** | something inside changed: thin dashed outline | |
| **<U+2192>** | moved or renamed, replaces one element: long dashes | |
endlegend
